{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The BR lowfit wagon was a type of low open merchandise wagon that was built for British Railways between 1950 and 1959. There were 3150 of these wagons, which had a wooden or steel body on a vacuum brake frame. They were used for carrying various goods, such as pipes, timber, machinery and scrap metal. Some of them were paired with another lowfit wagon and fitted with bolsters to carry long loads. The lowfit wagons had different styles of brake riggings, such as LNER, RCH or BR clasp brakes. They were painted in bauxite or grey livery and had a 12-ton capacity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006780?t=1761034499","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006780?t=1761034499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006780/fc2a2a6a3f2713fbbafb0331f4e706c95764942e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761034499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006780/fc2a2a6a3f2713fbbafb0331f4e706c95764942e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761034499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The BR lowfit wagon was a type of low open merchandise wagon that was built for British Railways between 1950 and 1959. There were 3150 of these wagons, which had a wooden or steel body on a vacuum brake frame. They were used for carrying various goods, such as pipes, timber, machinery and scrap metal. Some of them were paired with another lowfit wagon and fitted with bolsters to carr